{title: Lekar Hum Deewana Dil}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Asha Bhosle R D Burman}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Lekar hum deewana dil,        [Em]Phirte hain manzil manzil
[G]Kahin to pyaare kisi kinare,        [D]Mil jao tum andhere [C]ujaale
[Em]Ta ram pam Lekar hum deewana dil,        [Em]Phirte hain manzil manzil
[Em]Jis gali mein tum,        [Em]uss gali mein [D]hum
[Am]Par yeh majboori [G]yan [Em]yaha,        [Em]Tum yahin kahin,
[Em]hum yahin [D]kahin,        [Am]Phir bhi yeh doori [G]yaan [Em]yaha
[Em]Wah re [G]duniya,        [Em]Duniya tere jalwe hai [B]nirale haaa
[Em]Lekar hum deewana dil,        [Em]Phirte hain manzil manzil
[G]Kahin to pyaare kisi kinare,        [D]Mil jao tum andhere [C]ujaale
[Em]Ta ram pam Lekar hum deewana dil,        [Em]Phirte hain manzil manzil
[Em]Tu kahin rahe,        [Em]yoon lage [D]mujhe
[Am]Mere dil ke paas [G]hai [Em]yaha,        [Em]Maangu teri khair
[Em]aa tere [D]bagair,        [Am]Dil mera udaas [G]hai [Em]yaha
[Em]Aaja [G]aaja,        [Em]Aaja humko sine se [B]lagale ha aa
[Em]Lekar hum deewana dil,        [Em]Phirte hain manzil manzil
[G]Kahin to pyaare kisi kinare,        [D]Mil jao tum andhere [C]ujaale
[Em]Ta ram pam Lekar hum deewana dil,        [Em]Phirte hain manzil manzil
